ansparent px-3 text-[14px] font-bold transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 active:bg-gray-100" data-interaction="mobile-top-bar-log-in" href="/i/jf/onboarding/web?mode=login&amp;redirect_after_login=%2Fcoolish%2Fstatus%2F1663655466420035584">Log in</a><a class="bg-gray-1100 hover:bg-gray-1100/90 dark:text-gray-1100 flex h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-4 text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition-colors dark:bg-gray-100" href="/i/jf/onboarding/web?mode=signup&amp;redirect_after_login=%2Fcoolish%2Fstatus%2F1663655466420035584">Sign up</a></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--$--><h1 class="sr-only">paulwei on X: &quot;OXBT 这个名字，包含 Bitgod 对 Bitmex 的致敬。
是Bitmex发明了永续合约这个币圈拳头产品。
刚刚发现，Bitmex也上线了 $ordi 50x永续合约。不过成交量实在清淡，也几乎没人谈论此事。唏嘘，曾经的王者交易所。

The name OXBT is a tribute to Bitmex by @BitGod21. Bitmex invented perpetual contracts.
Just discovered that Bitmex has also launched a 50x perpetual contract for $ordi. However, the trading volume is currently quite low, and there is hardly any discussion about it. 
It&#x27;s nostalgic to see the former king of exchanges in such a state.
