是Bitmex发明了永续合约这个币圈拳头产品。
刚刚发现，Bitmex也上线了 </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" href="/search?q=%24ordi">$<!-- -->ordi</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 50x永续合约。不过成交量实在清淡，也几乎没人谈论此事。唏嘘，曾经的王者交易所。

The name OXBT is a tribute to Bitmex by </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/BitGod21">@<!-- -->BitGod21</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">. Bitmex invented perpetual contracts.
Just discovered that Bitmex has also launched a 50x perpetual contract for </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" href="/search?q=%24ordi">$<!-- -->ordi</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">. However, the trading volume is currently quite low, and there is hardly any discussion about it. 
